WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.445 --> 00:00:03.011
Lesson one. Hello!

2
00:00:03.917 --> 00:00:10.967
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:11.939 --> 00:00:16.809
Hi! I'm Teacher Coco. Hello, friends!

4
00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:18.667
Hello! I'm Mimi!

5
00:00:19.377 --> 00:00:26.108
Hello! Say it with me. Hello!

6
00:00:26.158 --> 00:00:28.186
Great! Hello!

7
00:00:31.331 --> 00:00:35.264
Bye-bye! Say it with me. Bye-bye!

8
00:00:39.255 --> 00:00:42.988
Yes! Nod your head. Yes!

9
00:00:46.987 --> 00:00:50.687
No! Shake your head. No!

10
00:00:54.693 --> 00:00:59.560
I'm a teacher. Teacher! Say it with me. Teacher!

11
00:01:03.554 --> 00:01:08.554
Mimi is my friend. Friend! Say it with me. Friend!

12
00:01:12.546 --> 00:01:13.999
What's your name?

13
00:01:14.049 --> 00:01:14.799
I'm Mimi!

14
00:01:14.831 --> 00:01:22.726
Now you. What's your name? Say, I'm...

15
00:01:22.776 --> 00:01:23.926
Lovely name!

16
00:01:25.158 --> 00:01:31.274
This is A. A is for apple. Apple! A is for ant. Ant!

17
00:01:35.272 --> 00:01:42.223
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

18
00:01:42.273 --> 00:01:43.900
Bye-bye, friends!

